es\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> damage and immunity to <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Poisoned\" title=\"Conditions\">Poisoned</a>.\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In Safe nº3 in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House#The_Co